---

Fonts are not bundled. With fonts.source = "google" the configured families are
downloaded at runtime from Google Fonts and cached locally; the default family,
Bitter, is licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.

The record sleeve artwork in nowspinning/ui/assets/ (sleeve.png and
sleeve-noart.png) is taken from the "Massive Vinyl 2" Bowtie theme by
Taylor Cohron. sleeve.png is a derivative: the paper inner sleeve was painted
out with tools/clean_sleeve.py so it does not read as a grey block at panel
sizes, and the drop shadow was removed by the author in favour of one the
renderer draws, which can be positioned and blurred from the config.

